window.FEATS=[{"s":"phb","c":"Origin","n":"Alert","p":"","t":"Add your Proficiency Bonus to Initiative rolls. Right after rolling, you can swap Initiative with a willing ally."},{"s":"phb","c":"Origin","n":"Crafter","p":"","t":"Proficiency with three Artisan’s Tools, 20% off nonmagical items you buy, and after a Long Rest you can quickly make a simple piece of gear."},{"s":"phb","c":"Origin","n":"Healer","p":"","t":"Use a Healer’s Kit to patch up an ally: they spend a Hit Die and regain the roll plus your Proficiency Bonus. You can also reroll 1s on healing dice."},{"s":"phb","c":"Origin","n":"Lucky","p":"","t":"Gain Luck Points equal to your Proficiency Bonus. Spend one for Advantage on a D20 Test, or to give an attacker Disadvantage against you. They return on a Long Rest."},{"s":"phb","c":"Origin","n":"Magic Initiate","p":"","t":"Learn two cantrips and one level 1 spell from the Cleric, Druid or Wizard list. Cast the spell once per Long Rest for free. Can be taken again with a different list."},{"s":"phb","c":"Origin","n":"Musician","p":"","t":"Proficiency with three musical instruments. After a rest, play a song so up to your Proficiency Bonus in allies gain Heroic Inspiration."},{"s":"phb","c":"Origin","n":"Savage Attacker","p":"","t":"Once per turn when you hit with a weapon, roll its damage dice twice and use either result."},{"s":"phb","c":"Origin","n":"Skilled","p":"","t":"Gain proficiency in any three skills or tools. Can be taken more than once."},{"s":"phb","c":"Origin","n":"Tavern Brawler","p":"","t":"Your Unarmed Strike deals 1d4, you can reroll 1s on its damage, you can shove on a hit once per turn, and you are proficient with improvised weapons."},{"s":"phb","c":"Origin","n":"Tough","p":"","t":"Your Hit Point maximum rises by twice your level, and by 2 more each time you level up."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Ability Score Improvement","p":"Level 4+","t":"Raise one ability score by 2, or two scores by 1 each (maximum 20). Can be taken more than once."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Actor","p":"Level 4+, Charisma 13+","t":"+1 Charisma. Advantage on Deception and Performance checks to pass as someone else, and you can mimic voices and sounds."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Athlete","p":"Level 4+, Strength or Dexterity 13+","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. Gain a Climb Speed equal to your Speed, stand from Prone using 5 feet of movement, and make running jumps after only 5 feet."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Charger","p":"Level 4+, Strength or Dexterity 13+","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. Dash 10 feet further, and after moving 10 feet in a line before a melee hit you can add 1d8 damage or push the target 10 feet."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Chef","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Constitution or Wisdom, proficiency with Cook’s Utensils. Cook short-rest meals that heal extra, and treats that grant Temporary Hit Points."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Crossbow Expert","p":"Level 4+, Dexterity 13+","t":"+1 Dexterity. Ignore the Loading property of crossbows, shoot in melee without Disadvantage, and dual-wield Light crossbows."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Crusher","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Strength or Constitution. Once per turn, a Bludgeoning hit moves the target 5 feet. A Bludgeoning critical gives your allies Advantage against it."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Defensive Duelist","p":"Level 4+, Dexterity 13+","t":"+1 Dexterity. While holding a Finesse weapon, use your Reaction to add your Proficiency Bonus to AC against a melee hit."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Dual Wielder","p":"Level 4+, Strength or Dexterity 13+","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. Make an extra bonus-action attack with a second melee weapon that lacks Two-Handed, and draw or stow two weapons at once."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Durable","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Constitution. Advantage on Death Saving Throws, and as a Bonus Action you can spend a Hit Die to heal."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Elemental Adept","p":"Level 4+, Spellcasting or Pact Magic","t":"+1 Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma. Your spells of one chosen element (acid, cold, fire, lightning or thunder) ignore Resistance and treat 1s on damage dice as 2s. Repeatable with a different element."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Fey-Touched","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma. Learn Misty Step and one level 1 Divination or Enchantment spell, each castable once per Long Rest for free."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Grappler","p":"Level 4+, Strength or Dexterity 13+","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. Punch and grab in one hit, gain Advantage against creatures you have Grappled, and move them at full speed."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Great Weapon Master","p":"Level 4+, Strength 13+","t":"+1 Strength. Add your Proficiency Bonus to damage with Heavy weapons, and after a critical hit or a kill you can attack again as a Bonus Action."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Heavily Armored","p":"Level 4+, Medium Armor Training","t":"+1 Constitution or Strength. Gain training with Heavy armor."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Heavy Armor Master","p":"Level 4+, Heavy Armor Training","t":"+1 Constitution or Strength. In Heavy armor, reduce Bludgeoning, Piercing and Slashing damage from each hit by your Proficiency Bonus."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Inspiring Leader","p":"Level 4+, Wisdom or Charisma 13+","t":"+1 Wisdom or Charisma. After a rest, give a speech that grants up to six allies Temporary Hit Points."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Keen Mind","p":"Level 4+, Intelligence 13+","t":"+1 Intelligence. Gain proficiency or Expertise in one of five lore skills, and take the Study action as a Bonus Action."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Lightly Armored","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. Gain training with Light armor and Shields."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Mage Slayer","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. Damaging a concentrating creature gives it Disadvantage on its save, and you can turn a failed mental save into a success once per rest."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Martial Weapon Training","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. Gain proficiency with Martial weapons."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Medium Armor Master","p":"Level 4+, Medium Armor Training","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. In Medium armor with Dexterity 16+, you add 3 to AC from Dexterity instead of 2."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Moderately Armored","p":"Level 4+, Light Armor Training","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. Gain training with Medium armor."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Mounted Combatant","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Strength, Dexterity or Wisdom. Advantage against smaller unmounted foes near your mount, and you can redirect attacks on your mount to yourself and shield it from area damage."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Observant","p":"Level 4+, Intelligence or Wisdom 13+","t":"+1 Intelligence or Wisdom. Gain proficiency or Expertise in Insight, Investigation or Perception, and take the Search action as a Bonus Action."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Piercer","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. Once per turn, reroll one damage die on a Piercing hit. Piercing critical hits add an extra die."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Poisoner","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Dexterity or Intelligence. Your poison damage ignores Resistance, and you can brew doses of poison that deal 2d8 Poison damage and poison the target."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Polearm Master","p":"Level 4+, Strength or Dexterity 13+","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. Make a bonus-action butt-end attack with a polearm or Quarterstaff, and get a Reaction attack when something enters your reach."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Resilient","p":"Level 4+","t":"Choose an ability you lack a saving throw proficiency in. Gain +1 to it and become proficient in its saves."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Ritual Caster","p":"Level 4+, Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma 13+","t":"+1 Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma. Always have a number of level 1 Ritual spells prepared, and cast one at its normal casting time without a slot once per Long Rest."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Sentinel","p":"Level 4+, Strength or Dexterity 13+","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. Get Opportunity Attacks against creatures that Disengage or attack your allies, and a hit sets their Speed to 0."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Shadow-Touched","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma. Learn Invisibility and one level 1 Illusion or Necromancy spell, each castable once per Long Rest for free."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Sharpshooter","p":"Level 4+, Dexterity 13+","t":"+1 Dexterity. Your ranged attacks ignore half and three-quarters cover, long range gives no Disadvantage, and being close to a foe does not hinder you."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Shield Master","p":"Level 4+, Shield Training","t":"+1 Strength. Shove with your Shield after attacking, and use your Reaction to take no damage from a Dexterity save you pass."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Skill Expert","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 to any ability score. Gain one skill proficiency and Expertise in one skill you already have."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Skulker","p":"Level 4+, Dexterity 13+","t":"+1 Dexterity. Blindsight 10 feet, Advantage on Hide checks in combat, and missing with a hidden attack does not reveal you."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Slasher","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. Once per turn, a Slashing hit cuts the target’s Speed by 10 feet. Slashing critical hits give the target Disadvantage on attacks."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Speedy","p":"Level 4+, Dexterity or Constitution 13+","t":"+1 Dexterity or Constitution. Speed rises by 10 feet, Difficult Terrain does not slow your Dash, and Opportunity Attacks against you have Disadvantage."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Spell Sniper","p":"Level 4+, Spellcasting or Pact Magic","t":"+1 Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma. Spell attacks ignore half and three-quarters cover, work in melee without Disadvantage, and gain 60 feet of range."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Telekinetic","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma. Learn Mage Hand (invisible, longer range, no components) and shove a creature 5 feet as a Bonus Action."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Telepathic","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma. Speak telepathically to creatures within 60 feet and cast Detect Thoughts once per Long Rest for free."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"War Caster","p":"Level 4+, Spellcasting or Pact Magic","t":"+1 Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma. Advantage on concentration saves, cast a spell instead of making an Opportunity Attack, and cast with full hands."},{"s":"phb","c":"General","n":"Weapon Master","p":"Level 4+","t":"+1 Strength or Dexterity. Use the mastery property of one weapon you are proficient with, and swap which weapon after a Long Rest."},{"s":"phb","c":"Fighting Style","n":"Archery","p":"Fighting Style feature","t":"+2 to attack rolls with ranged weapons."},{"s":"phb","c":"Fighting Style","n":"Blind Fighting","p":"Fighting Style feature","t":"Blindsight out to 10 feet."},{"s":"phb","c":"Fighting Style","n":"Defense","p":"Fighting Style feature","t":"+1 AC while wearing armor."},{"s":"phb","c":"Fighting Style","n":"Dueling","p":"Fighting Style feature","t":"+2 damage with a melee weapon held in one hand when you hold no other weapon."},{"s":"phb","c":"Fighting Style","n":"Great Weapon Fighting","p":"Fighting Style feature","t":"Treat a 1 or 2 on a damage die as a 3 with a two-handed melee weapon (Two-Handed or Versatile)."},{"s":"phb","c":"Fighting Style","n":"Interception","p":"Fighting Style feature","t":"Use your Reaction to reduce damage dealt to a nearby ally by 1d10 plus your Proficiency Bonus while holding a Shield or weapon."},{"s":"phb","c":"Fighting Style","n":"Protection","p":"Fighting Style feature","t":"Use your Reaction and Shield to impose Disadvantage on an attack against a nearby ally."},{"s":"phb","c":"Fighting Style","n":"Thrown Weapon Fighting","p":"Fighting Style feature","t":"+2 damage with thrown weapons, and you can draw them as part of the attack."},{"s":"phb","c":"Fighting Style","n":"Two-Weapon Fighting","p":"Fighting Style feature","t":"Add your ability modifier to the damage of the extra attack when two-weapon fighting."},{"s":"phb","c":"Fighting Style","n":"Unarmed Fighting","p":"Fighting Style feature","t":"Unarmed Strikes deal 1d6 (1d8 with empty hands), and you can deal 1d4 to a creature you have Grappled at the start of your turn."},{"s":"phb","c":"Epic Boon","n":"Boon of Combat Prowess","p":"Level 19+","t":"Raise one ability score by 1 (maximum 30). When you miss with an attack, you can hit instead, once until the start of your next turn."},{"s":"phb","c":"Epic Boon","n":"Boon of Dimensional Travel","p":"Level 19+","t":"Raise one ability score by 1 (maximum 30). After the Attack or Magic action, teleport up to 30 feet."},{"s":"phb","c":"Epic Boon","n":"Boon of Energy Resistance","p":"Level 19+","t":"Raise one ability score by 1 (maximum 30). Gain Resistance to two chosen damage types and redirect that damage at a nearby creature."},{"s":"phb","c":"Epic Boon","n":"Boon of Fate","p":"Level 19+","t":"Raise one ability score by 1 (maximum 30). Add or subtract 2d4 on a D20 Test made by you or a creature within 60 feet, once per Initiative or rest."},{"s":"phb","c":"Epic Boon","n":"Boon of Fortitude","p":"Level 19+","t":"Raise one ability score by 1 (maximum 30). Hit Point maximum +40, and healing is boosted by your Constitution modifier."},{"s":"phb","c":"Epic Boon","n":"Boon of Irresistible Offense","p":"Level 19+","t":"Raise Strength or Dexterity by 1 (maximum 30). Your weapon damage ignores Resistance, and a natural 20 adds extra damage."},{"s":"phb","c":"Epic Boon","n":"Boon of Recovery","p":"Level 19+","t":"Raise one ability score by 1 (maximum 30). Drop to 1 Hit Point instead of 0 once per Long Rest, and heal from a pool of ten d10s."},{"s":"phb","c":"Epic Boon","n":"Boon of Skill","p":"Level 19+","t":"Raise one ability score by 1 (maximum 30). Proficiency in all skills, plus Expertise in one."},{"s":"phb","c":"Epic Boon","n":"Boon of Speed","p":"Level 19+","t":"Raise one ability score by 1 (maximum 30). Speed +30 feet, and Disengage as a Bonus Action that also frees you from a grapple."},{"s":"phb","c":"Epic Boon","n":"Boon of Spell Recall","p":"Level 19+, Spellcasting","t":"Raise Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma by 1 (maximum 30). Casting with a level 1 to 4 slot can leave the slot unspent."},{"s":"phb","c":"Epic Boon","n":"Boon of the Night Spirit","p":"Level 19+","t":"Raise one ability score by 1 (maximum 30). In dim light or darkness, turn invisible as a Bonus Action and resist nearly all damage."},{"s":"phb","c":"Epic Boon","n":"Boon of Truesight","p":"Level 19+","t":"Raise one ability score by 1 (maximum 30). Truesight out to 60 feet."},{"s":"kll","c":"Active Martial","n":"Athlete","p":"4th level and proficiency in Athletics","t":"You can accomplish mythical feats of athletic prowess. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution by 1, to a maximum of 20. Athletic Movement. Gain your choice of a climbing speed or swimming speed equal to your movement speed.","pg":180},{"s":"kll","c":"Active Martial","n":"Bodyguard","p":"4th level and fighting style that uses your reaction to defend an allied creature","t":"Your reflexes and techniques safeguard your allies. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Leaping Saves. You can move up to 5 feet before using your reaction to protect an ally with a Fighting Style or Feat.","pg":181},{"s":"kll","c":"Active Martial","n":"Breaker","p":"4th level","t":"You master the breaking of any creature within your grasp. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength or Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Punishing Blows. You have advantage on attack rolls against a creature you are grappling.","pg":181},{"s":"kll","c":"Active Martial","n":"Brute","p":"4th level and proficiency in Intimidation","t":"Your attacks leave your enemies devastated and cowering in fear. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength or Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Brutal Effort. When you roll damage for a melee weapon attack, you can reroll the weapon’s damage dice and use either total.","pg":181},{"s":"kll","c":"Active Martial","n":"Charger","p":"4th level","t":"You master the reckless rush of smashing into the enemy line. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength or Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Heavy Momentum.","pg":182},{"s":"kll","c":"Active Martial","n":"Destroyer","p":"4th level","t":"You bring ruin to the battlefield, cleaving through hordes. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength or Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Cleaving Blows.","pg":182},{"s":"kll","c":"Active Martial","n":"Durable","p":"4th level","t":"You possess an implausible resilience and are capable of amazing feats of endurance. You gain the following the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength or Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Rapid Recovery.","pg":182},{"s":"kll","c":"Active Martial","n":"Grappler","p":"4th level","t":"You master grappling and leverage to pin and fling your foes. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength or Constitution by 1, to a maximum of 20. Quick Grabs. When you take the Attack action on your turn, you can make one unarmed strike or attempt to grapple as a bonus action.","pg":183},{"s":"kll","c":"Active Martial","n":"Line Breaker","p":"4th level","t":"You smash through your enemies, clearing the way for your allies. Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength or Constitution by 1, to a maximum of 20. Heavy Impacts. When you push a creature, if the creature's movement is stopped early by another creature, object, or terrain, they take 1d4 bludgeoning damage for each 5 feet…","pg":184},{"s":"kll","c":"Active Martial","n":"Ruffian","p":"4th level","t":"You have turned kicking people when they're down into an art form. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution by 1, to a maximum of 20. Painful Critical.","pg":184},{"s":"kll","c":"Active Martial","n":"Storm Shooter","p":"4th Level","t":"Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength, Dexterity or Constitution by 1, to a maximum of 20. Raining Death. If you kill a creature within a single ranged weapon attack (reducing it from maximum hit points to 0 hit points) using the Attack action on your turn, you can make one additional ranged weapon attack as a bonus…","pg":184},{"s":"kll","c":"Active Martial","n":"Striker","p":"4th level","t":"You move like the wind, striking faster than your foes can see. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Battlefield Dancer. Each time you hit a creature, your movement speed increases by 5 feet until the end of your turn.","pg":185},{"s":"kll","c":"Active Martial","n":"Weapon Thrower","p":"4th level","t":"You excel at hurling objects, with a remarkably lack of concern for aerodynamics. Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength or Constitution by 1, to a maximum of 20. Reckless Aerodynamics. All melee weapons gain the thrown 20/60 property for you, unless they already had the thrown property with a greater range.","pg":185},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Axe Expert","p":"","t":"You wield an axe like a force of nature, maximizing and embodying its relentless and unstoppable power. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Strength or Constitution ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Axe Rush.","pg":186},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Bow Expert","p":"","t":"Your relentless practice with a bow grants you the following benefits while using one: Ranging Shots. When you miss a ranged weapon attack with a bow, your next ranged weapon attack roll with a bow has advantage. Overwatch. As a bonus action, you can ready a shot until the start of your next turn.","pg":186},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Dagger Expert","p":"","t":"You wield daggers with perfection and poise, able to use them fluidly in any situation. Dagger Tricks. You can draw or stow any number of daggers during your turn. You have advantage on any ability check to conceal your daggers. Improved Critical. Your attacks with daggers score a critical hit on a roll of 19 or 20.","pg":186},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Flail Expert","p":"","t":"Your mastery with a flail allows you to use the challenging weapon with deadly skill. You gain the following benefits while wielding a flail: Dangerous Swings. When you miss a melee weapon attack made with a flail, you can make a new attack roll against another creature you of your choice within the weapon’s range.","pg":186},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Harpoon Expert","p":"","t":"You are resourceful and skilled when it comes the use of harpoons, gaining the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength or Constitution ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Throwing Arm. The normal range of your thrown weapons is doubled. Harpoon.","pg":187},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Impact Expert","p":"","t":"You have mastered heavy blows with bludgeoning weapons. When you hit a creature with a maul or greatclub, you gain a charge of momentum until the end of your current turn. You can expend your momentum charges as a bonus action on one of the following abilities.","pg":187},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Lance Master","p":"","t":"You use maximize the effectiveness of a lance, gaining the following benefits: Impaled Movement. While you are mounted, if you strike a creature smaller than your mount with a lance, you can push that creature until the end of your turn, you make another attack, or you move in something other than a straight line.","pg":187},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Morning Star Expert","p":"","t":"You have mastered the use of a morning star, and are able to leverage greater effectiveness from it. You gain the following features: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength or Constitution ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Improved Critical.","pg":187},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Natural Weapon Expert","p":"Have one or more natural weapons","t":"You master the use of your natural weapons, granting you the following benefits: Ferocity. As a bonus action, you can make a single weapon attack with your natural weapon. Natural Perfection. Your natural weapon damage die increases to 1d6.","pg":188},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Pike Master","p":"","t":"You master the effective use of a pike, making the most of its extreme range. Extended Reach. Your reach with a pike increases by 5 feet on your turn. Set for Charge. If you haven’t yet moved this turn, you can use your bonus action to set for charge, reducing your movement speed to 0 and gaining a second reaction that can only…","pg":188},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Stinger","p":"","t":"You specialize in the quiet and agonizing kill with subtle weapons. You gain the following benefits related to blowguns and darts: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Dexterity, Wisdom, or Constitution ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Efficient Poisons.","pg":188},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Swordmaster","p":"","t":"Your swordplay leverages every advantage to build momentum, allowing you to strike or defend in new ways. When wielding a sword, you gain a special Swordplay d6 die each time you successfully attack a creature with it. You can have a maximum number of Swordplay dice equal to your proficiency bonus.","pg":188},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Warhammer Expert","p":"","t":"Your mastery over a warhammer ensures that your blows never fail to wear down the enemy, becoming an inexorable threat to any foe. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength or Constitution ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Battering Blows.","pg":188},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"War Pick Expert","p":"","t":"You have mastered the use of a war pick, and are able to tear down the most formidable foes. Ability Score Increase. Increase your Strength or Constitution ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Siege Pick. Attacks you make with the war pick against objects deal double damage. Sunder.","pg":189},{"s":"kll","c":"Weapon","n":"Whip Expert","p":"4th level or higher","t":"You master using a whip, gaining the following benefits: Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Strength, Dexterity or Constitution ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Expert Handling.","pg":189},{"s":"kll","c":"Combat Style","n":"Versatile Weapon Master","p":"","t":"You are an expert on the fluid use of versatile weapons, changing stances to fit any situation. When you draw a versatile weapon you are proficient with, or start your turn while wielding one, you can enter a special stance as long as you aren’t wielding other weapons or a shield.","pg":189},{"s":"kll","c":"Combat Style","n":"Lightning Striker","p":"","t":"You have mastered wielding weapons with lightning speed, granting the following benefits: Quick Draw. Whenever you make an attack, you can draw a light melee weapon as part of taking the attack. Twin Strike.","pg":189},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"One with Wind","p":"4th level","t":"You have mastered the supernatural ability striking like the wind, gaining the following benefits: Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Strength, Dexterity, or Wisdom ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Wind Walker.","pg":190},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Fire Dancer","p":"4th level","t":"You’ve danced among the flames so long and with such skill that now the flames dance along with you. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Strength, Dexterity, or Charisma ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Through The Flames.","pg":190},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Burning Soul","p":"4th level","t":"You harbor within your soul an ember of the flame of life akin to the power of a phoenix. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Strength, Constitution or Charisma ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Resilient Life. You gain advantage on death saving throws.","pg":191},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Lightning Leaper","p":"4th level","t":"You master the art of moving like lightning... literally. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Strength, Dexterity, or Intelligence ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Lightning Dodge.","pg":192},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Lightning Rod","p":"4th level","t":"You learn to store lightning energy within your body. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Strength, Constitution, or Intelligence ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Lightning Draw.","pg":192},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Earth Shaper","p":"4th level","t":"You have mastered a special connection to the earth and can call upon the stones buried in to heed your calls. Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Strength, Constitution, or Wisdom modifier by 1, to a maximum of 20. Stone Forming. You learn the stone formingK cantrip. You gain the Stonewall special action (below).","pg":192},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Earth Binder","p":"4th level","t":"Your mastery of the earthly powers allows you to call upon its power to entrap foes. You gain the following the benefits: Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Strength, Constitution, or Wisdom modifier by 1, to a maximum of 20. Grasping Earth.","pg":193},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Water Weaver","p":"4th level","t":"You have mastered a special connection to water and can beckon it to your call. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Strength, Dexterity, or Wisdom ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Water Walker. You can walk on top of surfaces made of water as if they are solid ground.","pg":193},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Illusion Art","p":"4th level","t":"You master the arts of illusion, mastering a special art to create them through a unique method. You gain the following benefits: Mind Tricks. You learn the minor illusion cantrip and cast it without a material component, using a spellcasting ability modifier of your choice.","pg":194},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Void Art","p":"4th level","t":"After intense study and sudden enlightenment you’ve mastered the true essence of cutting through space itself. You gain the following benefits: Part Magic. When you succeed a Dexterity saving throw against a spell or similar magical effect and you would take half damage, you can use your reaction to cut the effect from…","pg":194},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Vanishing Trick","p":"8th level","t":"You master an esoteric art of vanishing and leaving something (or someone) behind in your space, swapping positions with them. You gain the following abilities: Decoy Death. If you would be reduced to 0 hit points as a result of taking damage, you can use Nether Swap as a reaction.","pg":194},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Dragon Form","p":"4th level","t":"You have learned to invoke the powers of a dragon. You gain the following features: Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Strength, Constitution, or Charisma ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Mystic Language. You learn draconic. If you already know draconic, you learn one additional language of your choice.","pg":195},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Dragon Breath Art","p":"4th level","t":"You master the art of gathering elemental power within yourself to unleash in blasts akin to a dragon’s breath. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Constitution, or Charisma ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Familiarity.","pg":195},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Thunderer","p":"4th level","t":"Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Strength or Constitution ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Stable Footing. You gain advantage from being knocked down by ground shaking or heaving. You gain the Quaking Smash special attack (below).","pg":196},{"s":"kll","c":"Mystic Path","n":"Titanic","p":"4th level","t":"You awaken or learn a mystical ability drawing on the ancient power of the titans. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Bonus. Increase your Strength, Constitution, or Wisdom ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20. Mystic Language. You learn giant.","pg":196},{"s":"kll","c":"Additional","n":"Helping Hand","p":"","t":"You are always there to give your allies a hand. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase Wisdom, Intelligence, or Charisma by 1, to a maximum of 20. Boosting Shoves. When a willing allied creature moves out of your reach, you can use your reaction to give them a boost, shoving them 5 feet.","pg":197},{"s":"kll","c":"Additional","n":"Occult Specialist","p":"Occultist","t":"You delve deeper into your tradition perfecting a new rite. You can select an Occult Rite from the Occultist class Occult Rite list. You cannot select a rite you already know, or one that requires a level restriction, even if you are already of that level.","pg":197},{"s":"kll","c":"Additional","n":"Primal Prodigy","p":"Warden","t":"Your connection to the primal power grows stronger. You learn one additional Primal Manifestation from the Warden Primal Manifestation list. You cannot select a manifestation you already know, or one that requires a level restriction, even if you are already of that level.","pg":197},{"s":"kll","c":"Additional","n":"Prophetic Dreamer","p":"","t":"When you sleep or fall deep within a trance, you often dream of prophetic events to come, vague hints and esoteric clues as to which paths may be beneficial to you, and which may lead to your doom.","pg":197},{"s":"kll","c":"Additional","n":"Synchronized Combatant","p":"4th level Warlord","t":"You have an intuitive understanding of your allies movement, allowing to coordinate perfectly with their actions. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase your Dexterity, Wisdom, or Charisma by 1. Synchronized Movement.","pg":197},{"s":"kll","c":"Additional","n":"Tactical Combatant","p":"4th level.","t":"You excel at creating opportunities for other. You gain the following benefits: Ability Score Increase. Increase one ability score of your choice by 1. Combat Help. Once per turn when you take the Attack action, you can replace one attack with the Help action. Varied Tactics.","pg":197},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Attunement","p":"","t":"Your attunement slots increase by 1.","pg":198},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Beasts","p":"","t":"You are permanently under the effect of speak with animals, and can cast animal friendship at will without any components or expending a spell slot. You lose this effect for 24 hours if you kill a beast.","pg":198},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Bond","p":"","t":"You and another willing creature become permanently bonded together by a magical connection. Any damage taken or healing done to either creature is split between the two creatures. Either creature can transfer their hit points to the other creature by touching them as an action if the other creature has less hit points than…","pg":198},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Carnage","p":"","t":"When you kill a creature with a weapon attack, you gain 5 temporary hit points and an additional action which can only be used to take the attack action (one weapon attack only) this additional action lasts until the end of your turn. Once you gain this bonus, you cannot gain it again until the start of your next turn.","pg":198},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Celestial Ascension","p":"","t":"Your creature type becomes Celestial. You gain resistance to radiant damage, and sprout angelic wings that grant you a flying speed of 30 feet. If you already have resistance to radiant damage, you gain immunity to radiant damage.","pg":198},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Crafting","p":"","t":"You gain advantage on all crafting checks or ability checks made with artisan tools.","pg":198},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Divine Blessing","p":"","t":"You are permanently under the effect of the bless spell.","pg":198},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Divine Guidance","p":"","t":"You are permanently under the effect of the guidance spell. The spell does not end when you make an ability check.","pg":198},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Draconic Inheritance","p":"","t":"Your creature type becomes dragon. You gain resistance to one of the following damage types; acid, cold, fire, lightning or poison damage (selected by the creature giving you the boon), and sprout draconic wings that grant you a flying speed of 30 feet.","pg":198},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Demonic Transformation","p":"","t":"Your creature type becomes fiend (demon). You gain resistance to fire and lightning damage. You sprout a demonic tail that can be used as a natural weapon, dealing 1d6 piercing damage and 1d6 poison damage. If you already have resistance to fire or lightning or damage, you gain immunity to the damage type. Boon vs.","pg":198},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Earth","p":"","t":"You gain resistance to poison damage and gain a tremorsense of 30 feet. You can cast become stoneK at will without any components or expending a spell slot. If you are already resistant to poison damage, you gain immunity to poison damage.","pg":198},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Everlasting Magic","p":"","t":"The duration of all your spells with a duration is doubled.","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Fire","p":"","t":"You gain resistance to fire damage and no longer suffer the effects of hot environments. You can cast become fireK at will without any components or expending a spell slot. If you already have resistance to fire damage, you gain immunity to fire damage.","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Freezing Water","p":"","t":"You gain resistance to cold damage and no longer suffer the effects of cold environments. You can cast become waterK at will without any components or expending a spell slot. If you already have resistance to cold damage, you gain immunity to cold damage.","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Illusions","p":"","t":"You can cast silent image at will without expending a spell slot. Additionally, you can see through all illusions, seeing them for what they are.","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Infernal Damnation","p":"","t":"Your creature type becomes fiend (devil). You gain resistance to fire and poison damage. You sprout infernal horns. If you already have resistance to fire or poison damage, they gain immunity to the damage type.","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of the Fairy","p":"","t":"You become one size smaller. You can cast faerie fire at will without any components or expending a spell slot. You gain butterfly wings that grant you a flying speed of 30 feet, but leave behind an ephemeral trail of glittering dust when you fly that lasts one round, giving you disadvantage on stealth checks when on any turn…","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of the Giant","p":"","t":"Your size increases to Large (if smaller than Large), and the damage of your melee weapon attacks increase by 1d4.","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Ghostly Passage","p":"","t":"As a bonus action, you can become ethereal until the start of your next turn. While ethereal, you can pass through creatures and objects without expending additional movement, but cannot end your turn inside an occupied space. You have resistance to all damage besides force and psychic damage.","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Martial Vigor","p":"","t":"All expended active martial feats you have gain a \"Recharge (6)\" ability, meaning that at the start of each of your turns, you roll a d6 for each one. On a 6, they are refreshed immediately.","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Mercy","p":"","t":"Whenever you restore hit points to another creature, you gain temporary hit points equal to the number of hit points restored.","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Misfortune","p":"","t":"A twisted boon that doesn't negate your bad luck, but lets you share it. Whenever you roll a 1 on the d20 for an attack roll, saving throw, or ability check, you can choose a creature within 60 feet. Their d20 next roll before the start of your next turn becomes a 1.","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Pacifism","p":"","t":"You are permanently under the effect of sanctuary. Any action that would normally break it still breaks it, but you regain the effect if you go 1 minute without taking an action that would break it.","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Quicksilver Steps","p":"","t":"As a reaction to being attacked or making a Dexterity saving throw, you can add your proficiency bonus to your AC or saving throw result. When you do so, you can move up to 10 feet without provoking opportunity attacks. Once you use this, you cannot use it again until you end your turn without moving more than 5 feet.","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Greater Boon","n":"Boon of Sacrifice","p":"","t":"As an action, you can touch a creature and transfer it a number of your hit points up to twice your character level. You cannot reduce your own hit points below 1 when transferring hit points this way.","pg":199},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Shadows","p":"","t":"While in dim light or darkness, you can take the Hide action as a bonus action. When you take Hide action in dim light or darkness, you become invisible until take another action, deal damage, cast a spell, or are no longer in dim light or darkness.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of the Brute","p":"","t":"You can add your Strength modifier to your Wisdom, Intelligence, and Charisma saving throws.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of the Chosen Hero","p":"","t":"You are permanently under the effect of the heroism spell.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of the Spiderqueen","p":"","t":"Your lower half becomes that of a spider. You are permanently under the effect of the spider climb spell and you can ignore movement restrictions caused by webbing. You deal an additional 1d4 poison damage on any weapon attack (including unarmed strikes or natural weapons) you make.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Time","p":"","t":"You gain the ability to cast time stop without expending a spell slot. When you cast it this way, it stops time for a number of turns equal to your proficiency bonus instead of rolling. Once you do so, you cannot do so again until you complete a long rest.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Undeath","p":"","t":"Your creature type becomes undead. You gain resistance to necrotic damage. You no longer need to eat, drink, or breathe. Additionally, if you are reduced to 0 hit points, you can make a Constitution saving throw with a DC equal to 5 + the damage taken. On success, your are reduced to 1 hit point instead.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Wind","p":"","t":"You gain resistance to lightning damage and no longer take fall damage from falling. You can cast become windK at will without any components or expending a spell slot. If you already have resistance to lightning damage, you gain immunity to lightning damage.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Babble","p":"","t":"You can understand, speak, and read all languages","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Bounding","p":"","t":"Your long and high jumping distance is doubled.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Coins","p":"","t":"Each month, the amount of any coin you own or have stored increases by five percent. This property ceases to functions for that month if the coins are carefully observed during that time.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Doggos (Prerequisite: Good Alignment)","p":"","t":"All dogs treat you as a friendly creature. You lose this boon if your alignment ever becomes neutral or evil.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Divine Light","p":"","t":"You can emit 15 feet of bright light, and an additional 15 feet of dim light. The bright light is sunlight. You can douse or relight this light at any time without using an action.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Endless Masks","p":"","t":"You gain the ability to cast disguise self at will. The spell lasts until you dismiss it when you cast it this way.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Fair Winds","p":"","t":"The wind always blows in a favorable direction while you are sailing on the water.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Heavy Hands","p":"","t":"Your unarmed strikes become considered natural weapons having the Heavy property, and their damage increases to 1d8. If you are Small, you ignore the disadvantage imposed by the Heavy property for unarmed strikes.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Inventory","p":"","t":"You gain a sub-dimensional space allowing you to store up to items in space roughly 64 cubic feet. As an action, you can place an item that you can carry into this space, or retrieve an item that is already in the space. You cannot place living things into this space.","pg":200},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Iron","p":"","t":"You gain proficiency in all armor and weapons.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Ink","p":"","t":"Copying spells into your spellbook, spellmanual, or similar record of spells no longer costs gold.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Opened Mind","p":"","t":"You gain telepathy, which you can use to communicate with other creatures within 60 feet of you. You do not need to share a language, but a creature must speak at least one language to understand you. The creatures reply to messages sent this way.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Plenty","p":"","t":"You gain the ability to cast goodberry without expending a spell slot. Berries created this way are particularly delicious. Once you use this ability, you cannot use it again until you complete a long rest.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Steady Hands","p":"","t":"Being drunk no longer gives you disadvantage on attack rolls or ability checks.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Swiftness","p":"","t":"Your movement speed increases by 10 feet.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Talent","p":"","t":"You gain proficiency in one skill of the entity granting the boon’s choice. If you are already proficient in that skill, you gain expertise in the skill.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of the Dancer","p":"","t":"You gain advantage on all Dexterity saving throws, and all ability checks involving dancing. When you dance, special effects based on the granter of the boon may appear (such as rays of moonlight).","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of the Familiar","p":"","t":"You gain the ability to cast find familiar without any components or expending a spell slot. Once you do so, you cannot do so again until you complete a long rest.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of the Phoenix","p":"","t":"The first time you would die after receiving this boon, you are instead consumed by a pillar of flames shaped like a phoenix. In this fire you are healed for a number of hit points equal to your maximum and release a wave of fire hitting all creatures within 20 feet.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of the Sea","p":"","t":"You gain the ability to breathe underwater, and gain a swimming speed equal to walking speed.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of the Shroud","p":"","t":"You are permanently under the effect of nondetection, though the effect can be pierced by any entity of greater power than one that granted this boon.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of the Steed","p":"","t":"You gain the ability to cast find steed without any components or expending a spell slot. Once you do so, you cannot do so again until you complete a long rest.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of the Twisted Tongue","p":"","t":"Insight checks and spells cannot reveal your deceptions or compel you to speak the truth, unless they are performed by an entity of greater power than the one that granted you the boon.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Tiny Might","p":"","t":"Being small or tiny no longer imposes disadvantage when using weapons with the Heavy property.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Twilight","p":"","t":"You gain darkvision out to a range of 300 feet.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Youth","p":"","t":"You cease to visually age, and can even choose to become more youthful in appearance, though your lifespan remains the natural lifespan of your race.","pg":201},{"s":"kll","c":"Minor Boon","n":"Boon of Vengeance","p":"","t":"You gain advantage on all attack rolls and ability checks against one specific creature (defined by the entity granting the bond). Spells By Class Brilliant Blade Bard Immutability Cantrips (0 level) Illusionary Dart 4th Level Commandment 1st Level Heavenly Ray Awaken Rope Vital Surge Blade Mirage Illusory Pit 5th Level Induce…","pg":201},{"s":"kcc","c":"Feats","n":"Adept Poisoner","p":"","t":"You specialize in developing poisons, granting you proficiency with poisoner’s kits and the following benefits: When you create a poison, you can specify a creature type that poison is specifically made for. That poison ignores resistance and immunity to poison damage for that creature.","pg":124},{"s":"kcc","c":"Feats","n":"Expert Alchemist","p":"Proficiency with alchemist’s supplies","t":"Your long practice of alchemy has granted you the following benefits: Your Intelligence or Wisdom ability score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20. When you make an Alchemy crafting check, you can take 10 as the result of the d20 (instead of rolling) without spending additional time.","pg":124},{"s":"kcc","c":"Feats","n":"Expert Blacksmith","p":"Proficiency with smith’s tools","t":"Your long practice of blacksmithing has granted you the following benefits: Your Strength ability score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20. When you make an Blacksmithing crafting check, you can take 10 as the result of the d20 (instead of rolling) without spending additional time.","pg":124},{"s":"kcc","c":"Feats","n":"Expert Cook","p":"Proficiency with cook’s utensils","t":"Your long experience with cooking has granted you the following benefits: Your Wisdom ability score increase by 1, to a maximum of 20. When you make a Cooking crafting check, you can take 10 as the result of the d20 (instead of rolling) without spending additional time.","pg":124},{"s":"kcc","c":"Feats","n":"Expert Tinkerer","p":"Proficiency with tinker’s tools","t":"Your long experience with tinkering has granted you the following benefits: Your Intelligence ability score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20. When you make a Tinkering crafting check, you can take 10 as the result of the d20 (instead of rolling) without spending additional time.","pg":124},{"s":"kcc","c":"Feats","n":"Magical Researcher","p":"Proficiency in the Arcana skill","t":"You delve the secrets of magic. You can make scrolls of spells you don’t know, but each crafting check takes 8 hours (this can be completed incrementally). When you craft a scroll or make a magic item that reproduces a spell that deals damage, you can change the damage type of that spell it reproduces.","pg":124},{"s":"kcc","c":"Feats","n":"Old Hand","p":"","t":"You have mastered the way of your craft in a way the young whippersnappers can only dream of. You can leverage your vast knowledge of the craft to use your Intelligence or Wisdom modifier in place of Strength or Dexterity in a branch of crafting that you have proficiency in the related tool of.","pg":124},{"s":"kcc","c":"Feats","n":"Resourceful","p":"","t":"You’ve mastered every play that’ll give you an edge when it comes to using common items, and gain the following benefits: You are proficient with improvised weapons. You can add your proficiency bonus to the saving throw DC for common items used by you.","pg":125},{"s":"kcc","c":"Feats","n":"School Specialist","p":"The ability to cast at least one spell","t":"When you gain this feat, choose one of the following schools of magic: Abjuration, Divination, Conjuration, Enchantment, Evocation, Illusion, Necromancy, or Transmutation. You learn a spell from the selected school.","pg":125},{"s":"kcc","c":"Feats","n":"Soul Investor","p":"","t":"You have the special gift to invest your soul into magic items. This becomes a new way to enchant permanent magic items for you, allowing you to replace an essence in a crafting check with part of your soul.","pg":125},{"s":"kcc","c":"Feats","n":"Tool Expert","p":"","t":"You have honed your proficiency with particular tools, granting you the following benefits: Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20. You gain proficiency with one tool of your choice. Choose one tool in which you have proficiency.","pg":125},{"s":"kcc","c":"Feats","n":"Ultimate Improviser","p":"","t":"You find new ways to do anything. You gain the following benefits: Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20. You can improvise a replacement for any material that costs a number of gold pieces less than or equal to your character level.","pg":125},{"s":"kcc","c":"Feats","n":"Wand Slinger","p":"","t":"If you have a spell save DC higher than a wand you are attuned to, you can use your spell save DC instead. If you expend the last charge of a wand, you do not need to make a roll to see if it is destroyed.","pg":126},{"s":"kcc","c":"Inventor","n":"Innovator’s Upgrade","p":"Inventor","t":"You’ve honed your mind into a nonstop analytical machine. You can select an additional upgrade from your subclass list. The upgrade must be from the Unrestricted list. This upgrade doesn’t count against your class upgrade total.","pg":126},{"s":"kcc","c":"Inventor","n":"Mental Adaptability","p":"Inventor","t":"You’ve found ways to think outside the box, making connections that other—lesser—minds can never seem to understand. When you have to make an Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma saving throw, you can roll all three and pick the highest result. Once you do this, you can’t do it again until you finish a long rest.","pg":126},{"s":"kcc","c":"Inventor","n":"Rune Expert","p":"Inventor","t":"You can select a single Runic Mark from the Inventor Runesmith subclass. You learn and can mark this rune as per the Runic Mark feature of the Inventor class. Psion Feats","pg":126},{"s":"kcc","c":"Psion","n":"Inner Power","p":"At least 1 psi or ki point","t":"Your body is powered by the inner powers that course through it. Your maximum psi or ki points (if you have both, your choice of which) increases by 1. At the end of your turn after expending one or more psi or ki points during your turn Inventor | Psion | Toolbox | Subclasses | Backgrounds (not counting temporary or free…","pg":126},{"s":"kcc","c":"Psion","n":"Psionic Adept","p":"","t":"You develop a minor grasp of psionic power, either uncovering an innate potential within yourself, through contact with a psionic source, or through training. You gain one of the psionic disciplines of the Psion class, gaining the attached psionic feature and psionic power, but you do not gain use of any associated spells when…","pg":126},{"s":"kcc","c":"Psion","n":"Psionic Mind","p":"The ability to use at least one psionic discipline","t":"You tap deeper into your psionic potential drawing out a new talent. You can select a psionic talent from the Psion class psionic talent list. You can’t select a talent you already know, or one that requires a level restriction, even if you are already of that level.","pg":126},{"s":"kcc","c":"Psion","n":"War Psion","p":"The ability to use at least one psionic discipline","t":"You have mastered utilizing psionics in the midst of combat, learning techniques that grant you the following benefits: You have advantage on Constitution saving throws that you make to maintain your concentration on a psionic ability when you take damage.","pg":126},{"s":"kcc","c":"Ironwrought","n":"Upgraded","p":"Ironwrought","t":"You can apply one unrestricted Golemsmith or Warsmith upgrade to yourself (as if you were the golem or the warplate). This can’t be an upgrade that increases your ability scores. Any ability the does the same thing as a feature from Modular Design doesn’t stack.","pg":127},{"s":"kcc","c":"Ironwrought","n":"Specialized","p":"Ironwrought","t":"You have additional specialized systems integrated into your form. You can selected two additional options from the Modular Design feature of your race.","pg":127},{"s":"kcc","c":"Ironwrought","n":"Subsystem","p":"Ironwrought","t":"You gain the ability to divide your attention into a subroutine that can operate somewhat independently from your primary mind. You gain the following benefits from it: You can use this subsystem to maintain concentration on a cantrip.","pg":127},{"s":"kcc","c":"Farling","n":"Alien Weapon Training","p":"Farling","t":"You gain the ability to use a weapon, and the ability to use it in unique ways. You gain proficiency with one weapon of your choice, and when you gain proficiency with it you gain the ability to use it an unorthodox manner other creatures may find strange.","pg":127},{"s":"kcc","c":"Farling","n":"Aquatic Adaption","p":"Farling","t":"Your aquatic adaptions are more extensive. You gain the following traits: Your Constitution score increases by 1. You can breath under water. You gain a swimming speed of 40 feet. You gain resistance to your choice of acid or cold damage.","pg":127},{"s":"kcc","c":"Farling","n":"Flexible Form","p":"Farling","t":"You find the your material body isn’t quite as set in stone as other mortals, being more of a whim of expression. You can minorly change your appearance (coloration, hair length, superficial features) or adapt yourself to new environments, gaining resistance to one type of damage of your choice from acid, cold, fire, lightning,…","pg":127},{"s":"kcc","c":"Farling","n":"Spell Library","p":"Farling, any class with the Spellcasting or Pact Magic feature","t":"Your ability to perfectly memorize that which you experience enhances your ability to grasp and memorize spells. The number of spells you know or can prepare for one class you have levels in (your choice if you have multiple) increases by your proficiency bonus.","pg":127},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Arcane Specialist","p":"the ability to cast at least 1st-level spells using spell slots","t":"You research specific schools of magic, learning about esoteric magic groups and adding them to your repertoire. You gain the following benefits: Your spellcasting ability score increases by 1. If you have multiple, you must choose one. Choose one spell group from this book’s spells section.","pg":331},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Berserker","p":"","t":"You can lash out against those who have harmed you in the moments preceding your attack. You gain the following benefits: Your Strength or Dexterity score increases by 1. If a creature has hit you since the end of your last turn, your next weapon attack against them has advantage.","pg":331},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Celestial Allowance","p":"Cleric, Favored Soul, Paladin or Petal Knight","t":"Your weapons are infused with divine might, allowing you to strike at fiends and undead with greater tenacity. You gain the following benefits: Your Wisdom or Charisma score increases by 1. When you hit an undead creature with a weapon attack, that creature takes additional damage equal to your Charisma modifier.","pg":331},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Complete Armor Master","p":"any of the Light Armor Master, Medium Armor Master, or Heavy Armor Master feats","t":"You gain total proficiency in using armor you have trained in, gaining the following benefits: Your walking speed increases by 10 feet when unarmored. You can use your bonus action to enter a defensive stance until the start of your next turn.","pg":331},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Critical Flourish","p":"","t":"When you strike a creature and score a critical hit, you can use the opportunity to inflict greater damage upon them. Your Strength, Dexterity or Constitution score increases by 1. Once per turn, when you score a critical hit on an attack roll (or roll a d20 result of 20 on grapple and shove attempts), you may make one weapon…","pg":331},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Damning Rebuke","p":"Turn Undead (Channel Divinity) feature","t":"Guided by divine power, your ability to turn away the undead also unleashes radiant energy that burns flesh. You gain the following benefits: When you use your Channel Divinity to use Turn Undead, all undead creatures that fail their saving throw against it take radiant damage equal to 1d4 multiplied by your proficiency bonus.","pg":332},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Death Stroke","p":"Strength or Dexterity score of 17 or higher","t":"When presented with an opportunity to deal greater damage, you take it - unprepared opponents are who left devastated by your hand. Your Strength or Dexterity score increases by 1. If you hit a creature that is restrained or incapacitated with a weapon attack, that attack automatically deals one additional weapon die of damage.","pg":332},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Fatigue Resistance","p":"","t":"You are used to being worn out, and exposure to combat conditions helps you push back the effects of fatigue when injured in battle. You gain the following benefits: Your Constitution score increases by 1. The limit of Combat Fatigue you can accumulate at a time is half your proficiency bonus (rounded up).","pg":332},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Fighting Style Advancement","p":"","t":"You build on your combat skills, gaining the following benefits: One of your Ability Scores increases by 1. You may advance one of your existing fighting styles to its next tier. If you do not have a fighting style to advance, you learn one available to the Fighter instead. You may take this feat multiple times.","pg":332},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Firearm Expert","p":"proficiency with simple and/or ranged weapons","t":"You learn to wield firearms and become highly proficient in their use. You gain the following benefits: You gain proficiency in simple and martial firearms, as long as you have the corresponding proficiency in simple and/or martial ranged weapons. You can reload firearms with a reaction instead of a bonus action.","pg":332},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Ingrained Expertise","p":"","t":"You have refined your talents to a masterful degree. Choose one of the following options: Choose two skills you have proficiency in. You gain Expertise in those skills. Choose one skill you have proficiency in. You gain Expertise in that skill, and the Ability Score you use for it increases by 1.","pg":332},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Light Armor Master","p":"proficiency with light armor","t":"While you are wearing light armor you can take advantage of its flexibility to move more freely. You gain the following benefits: Your Dexterity score increases by 1. While you are wearing light armor you can still benefit from features or armor class calculations that would normally require you to be unarmored.","pg":332},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Light Weapon Master","p":"","t":"You can sacrifice striking power to ensure that your attacks will find purchase. You gain the following benefits: On your turn, if you make a weapon attack and miss using a light or finesse melee weapon, you can use your bonus action to treat that attack’s d20 result as a 15 instead.","pg":333},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Lion’s War Cry","p":"Red Lion Knight subclass or Charisma score 16 or higher","t":"You can lead others through powerful declaration to rally them forward. Your Charisma score increases by 1. Once per Short Rest, when you roll initiative in combat, you may use your reaction to give a rallying cry to your allies that can hear you within 30 feet.","pg":333},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Multi-Casting","p":"Your spellcasting ability score is 17 or higher.","t":"With practice and focus you can compartmentalize the processes that the magical energy running through you requires. You are able to support two distinct effects at a time. You gain the following benefits: Your spellcasting ability score increases by 1.","pg":333},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Piercing Reach","p":"proficiency in a weapon with the reach property, and in either the Athletics skill or Strength saving throws","t":"While wielding a long weapon you can attempt to strike through it to another creature if an opportunity presents itself. You gain the following benefits: Your Strength score increases by 1.","pg":333},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Promise of Certainty","p":"you have at least 2 levels as a Petal Knight.","t":"You can invoke the power of your epithet to manifest supernatural protection. You gain the following benefits: Your Charisma score increases by 1. Choose two ability scores. Whenever you fail a save with either ability score, you may re-roll the saving throw and keep the new result.","pg":333},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Promise of Companionship","p":"you have at least 2 levels as a Petal Knight.","t":"You can express your intentions to rely on an ally and coordinate with that defense in mind. You gain the following benefits: Your Strength or Constitution score increases by 1. You can spend 1 minute with a creature that understands you, assuring them that you plan to fight beside them, exchanging notes and strategies.","pg":333},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Promise of Efficacy","p":"you have at least 2 levels as a Petal Knight.","t":"You have pin-point accuracy when attacking a target so long as you have a distinct mastery of the weapon you’re wielding. You gain the following benefits: Your Strength or Dexterity score increases by 1.","pg":334},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Promise of Levity","p":"you have at least 2 levels as a Petal Knight.","t":"You can identify problems with your allies and help them to fight their way through it, reassuring them that you have their back as long as they have yours. You gain the following benefits: Your Charisma score increases by 1.","pg":334},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Promise of Planar Defense","p":"you have at least 2 levels as a Petal Knight.","t":"You can sense disturbances in the natural order of the world, mentally seeking out powerful monstrosities. You gain the following benefits: Your Intelligence score increases by 1. You can use an action to open your mind to the world around you until the end of your next turn, sensing aberrations and monstrosities within 120…","pg":334},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Promise of Understanding","p":"you have at least 2 levels as a Petal Knight.","t":"You can empathize with others and use your influence to calm their spirit, even communicating with creatures you choose. You gain the following benefits: Your Wisdom or Charisma score increases by 1.","pg":334},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Ranged Weapon Master","p":"proficiency in at least one ranged weapon or firearm","t":"You can aim and strike with ranged weapons more efficiently, with a keener eye for striking far away targets. You gain the following benefits: If you make a ranged weapon attack with advantage you can add your Intelligence modifier to its resulting damage roll.","pg":334},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Sign Casting","p":"you can cast at least one 1st-level spell or higher","t":"Using sign language you are able to draw arcane symbols in the air with your fingers to compensate for verbal components. When casting a spell with verbal components you can forgo them (and any speech required by the spell) to perform an equivalent as somatic components instead - spells cast this way are treated as having…","pg":335},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Spell Sufferance","p":"the ability to cast at least one 1st level or higher spell.","t":"Your spells are more devastating, and your aim with them has improved. You gain the following benefits: Your spellcasting ability score increases by 1. Your spell attacks score a critical hit on a d20 result of 19 or 20.","pg":335},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Survival Master","p":"proficiency in the Survival skill","t":"You are a savant at scavenging for food, even in environments you aren’t familiar with. You gain the following benefits: You gain Expertise in Survival checks. You have advantage on any ability checks made to recognize if flora or fauna would be dangerous to touch in conditions where it might be toxic, corrosive, or otherwise…","pg":335},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Tactician’s Command","p":"Charisma score of 14 or higher","t":"You can observe opponents from afar and direct your allies to fight them more efficiently in dire circumstances. You gain the following benefits: Your Charisma score increases by 1. Once per turn, when an ally you can see and who can hear you makes a weapon attack, you can give them advantage on the attack.","pg":335},{"s":"retia","c":"Somnus Domina","n":"Unshakable","p":"","t":"You are difficult to keep down and have a fighting will that keeps you alive in the face of death. You gain the following benefits: Your Constitution score increases by 1. When you roll a 19 or 20 on a death saving throw you regain 1 hit point. When you are stabilized at 0 hit points, roll 1d100.","pg":335}];